SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ffmmaa(), ffmmaaff(), and ffmmaall() functions conform to ISO/IEC 9899:1999
     (“ISO C99”).  A fused multiply-add operation with virtually identical
     characteristics appears in IEEE draft standard 754R.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ffmmaa() and ffmmaaff() routines first appeared in FreeBSD 5.4, and ffmmaall()
     appeared in FreeBSD 6.0.

